sequenceDiagram
    actor Visitor as Посетитель
    participant UI as Collect / SubmitForm
    participant API as Existing testimonials API
    participant DB as PostgreSQL app_service
    participant S3 as Synthetic local S3 при QA
    participant Photo as Existing photo GET
    actor Owner as Владелец
    participant Moderate as Existing owner moderation API
    participant Publish as Wall / external Widget
    Visitor->>UI: Имя, роль, текст, photo
    UI-->>Visitor: Blob preview; прежний URL освобождён
    Visitor->>UI: Submit
    UI->>API: Async multipart; sending блокирует повторный click
    API->>DB: Resolve active slug; check rate limit
    Note over API: Text/role/name + MIME/signature/5 MiB validation
    API->>DB: Record quota
    API->>S3: Настоящий product SDK PUT unchanged bytes
    alt Storage failure
        S3-->>API: Failure
        API->>DB: Revoke quota
        API-->>UI: 503
        UI-->>Visitor: Ввод/файл сохранён; retry доступен
    else Upload success
        S3-->>API: Object key
        API->>DB: Pending testimonial + testimonial_created; COMMIT
        API-->>UI: 201 public_id
        UI-->>Visitor: Thanks; после проверки владельцем
        Owner->>Moderate: Approve
        Moderate->>DB: withAccount; status transition и COMMIT
        Publish->>DB: Active project и approved/project filter
        DB-->>Publish: Отзыв с photo route URL
        Publish->>Photo: GET opaque key
        Photo->>S3: Настоящий SDK GET
        S3-->>Photo: Bytes
        Photo-->>Publish: Sniffed raster + nosniff/CSP/immutable
    end
    Note over DB,Photo: Listing approval и key-based media access — отдельные контракты
